    "Claude CLI · extra arguments": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-CLI · zusätzliche Argumente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code Hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Code-Hooks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code reads from ~/.claude/skills; Save exports the complete skill folder including its supporting files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code liest aus ~/.claude/skills; Sichern exportiert den vollständigen Skill-Ordner samt zugehöriger Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code reads from ~/.claude/skills; other tools need the file copied manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code liest aus ~/.claude/skills; andere Tools brauchen die Datei manuell kopiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code sessions started by WhisperM8 get all of these skills automatically through the whisperm8 plugin (as /whisperm8:<skill>, in every account profile). Nothing to install. Save, Copy, and View remain for other tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von WhisperM8 gestartete Claude-Code-Sitzungen erhalten alle diese Skills automatisch über das whisperm8-Plugin (als /whisperm8:<skill>, in jedem Kontoprofil). Nichts zu installieren. Sichern, Kopieren und Ansehen bleiben für andere Tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code status line: repo/branch, context usage with exact token count (incl. GPT sessions via the 272k window), model, effort, account usage limits, active subagents (Claude & GPT), and the active account profile. Native subagent rows also show the model actually used for each task.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statuszeile von Claude Code: Repo/Branch, Kontextnutzung mit exakter Token-Zahl (auch GPT-Sitzungen über das 272k-Fenster), Modell, Aufwand, Nutzungslimits des Kontos, aktive Subagents (Claude und GPT) und das aktive Kontoprofil. Native Subagent-Zeilen zeigen zusätzlich das tatsächlich verwendete Modell je Aufgabe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude account profile of this session": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Account-Profil dieser Session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude accounts and profiles (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR) for multi-account sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Konten und -Profile (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR) für Sitzungen mit mehreren Konten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude accounts as separate profiles (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR). Sessions are stamped with their account and resume under it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Konten als getrennte Profile (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR). Sitzungen tragen den Stempel ihres Kontos und werden darunter fortgesetzt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude accounts: usage limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Accounts: Usage-Limits"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude accounts: usage limits — login needs renewal: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Accounts: Usage-Limits. Login muss erneuert werden: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude chats start with a temporary hook configuration that links each chat to its Claude session. Live status comes from Claude's own session registry; your global ~/.claude/settings.json stays untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Chats starten mit einer temporären Hook-Konfiguration, die jeden Chat mit seiner Claude-Sitzung verknüpft. Der Live-Status kommt aus Claudes eigener Sitzungs-Registry; deine globale ~/.claude/settings.json bleibt unberührt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude logins need renewal": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude-Logins müssen erneuert werden"
          }
        }
      }
